sum(item_yr_opqty) + sum(op_rec_qty) - sum(op_ret_rec_qty)-sum(op_adjm_qty)-sum(op_iss_qty) + sum(op_ret_iss_qty) + sum(op_adjp_qty) as closingstock,
sum(item_yr_opval) + sum(op_rec_val) - sum(op_ret_rec_val)-sum(op_adjm_val)-sum(op_iss_val) + sum(op_ret_iss_val) + sum(op_adjp_val) as closingvalue , sum(item_stock) item_stock ,max(item_avg_rate) item_avg_rate
from (
